WEBVTT

01:31.966 --> 01:37.284
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.284 --> 01:40.343
[Episode 9]

01:40.879 --> 01:42.120
In the past, there was Tao Qian

01:42.120 --> 01:43.719
who wouldn't bow for five dou of rice.

01:44.879 --> 01:48.439
Today, there is the Floral Envoy

01:48.439 --> 01:50.719
who pledges allegiance for a leopard.

01:50.719 --> 01:52.239
It seems you

01:52.239 --> 01:53.599
not only enjoys appreciating flowers

01:55.079 --> 01:56.439
but also likes taming beasts.

02:06.439 --> 02:07.480
Superficial.

02:12.240 --> 02:13.759
I am very devoted.

02:13.759 --> 02:15.159
I only love money.

02:16.319 --> 02:17.360
Coincidentally,

02:18.000 --> 02:19.360
I only love money too.

02:21.159 --> 02:24.479
It is fitting to partner with you
to make money.

02:32.520 --> 02:34.120
Splitting the profits fifty-fifty?

02:36.159 --> 02:37.832
Impossible.

02:40.039 --> 02:41.360
Mr. Jiang,

02:41.360 --> 02:43.080
I am just borrowing your capital.

02:43.080 --> 02:44.280
All the dirty and tiring work

02:44.280 --> 02:45.879
will all be done by me.

02:45.879 --> 02:47.080
You only need

02:47.080 --> 02:48.680
to lie down and collect the money.

02:48.680 --> 02:50.080
A fifty-fifty split is fair enough.

02:53.479 --> 02:54.560
Moreover, today.

02:54.560 --> 02:56.639
I helped you block the unwanted admirers

02:56.639 --> 02:58.560
and nearly got my head shot through.

02:58.560 --> 02:59.560
You must at least

03:00.280 --> 03:01.639
remember some of my good deeds, right?

03:03.360 --> 03:04.479
Whether you came or not,

03:05.039 --> 03:07.039
I can block the unwanted admirers myself today.

03:07.919 --> 03:09.280
It was actually me

03:09.280 --> 03:10.800
who saved your life.

03:14.080 --> 03:15.336
- I…
- Well,

03:16.439 --> 03:18.800
seeing your cleverness
in playing the part today,

03:19.400 --> 03:21.840
you do have somewhat
of a sly merchant's adaptability.

03:23.919 --> 03:25.319
Collaboration is not out of the question.

03:33.415 --> 03:34.534
[Fifty-fifty]

03:37.680 --> 03:39.199
If we profit, the split is ninety-ten.

03:39.199 --> 03:42.879
If we lose, I'll pay back all the capital.

03:42.879 --> 03:44.479
Isn't that what you said?

03:44.479 --> 03:46.439
A godsend opportunity,
a sure win without losses.

03:47.280 --> 03:48.800
I'm taking a bit of a loss.

03:48.800 --> 03:50.000
If you sign this,

03:50.000 --> 03:52.120
the promissory note for the 19 potted flowers

03:52.120 --> 03:53.120
will be written off.

03:55.080 --> 03:57.599
Darned official Jiang, filthy merchant.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.400
Don't think I can't see

04:00.400 --> 04:01.960
your grumbling under your breath.

04:01.960 --> 04:03.599
- No.
- Forget it.

04:03.599 --> 04:05.199
It's better

04:05.199 --> 04:06.879
to lend the money at the capital
to earn interest.

04:06.879 --> 04:08.280
No.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.479
Mr. Jiang, I will sign.

04:09.479 --> 04:10.639
I will sign right away.

04:13.573 --> 04:16.115
[Jiang Xiaohua]

04:18.720 --> 04:20.519
I'm grateful

04:20.519 --> 04:22.319
for your appreciation.

04:22.319 --> 04:24.079
In the future, I will surely work tirelessly

04:24.720 --> 04:26.079
to make money.

04:35.560 --> 04:36.776
Chuanyu.

04:39.000 --> 04:40.000
My lord.

04:40.000 --> 04:42.536
Come in to pack up the things. We're leaving.

04:42.536 --> 04:43.759
Yes.

04:43.759 --> 04:46.120
Let me pack up together with Chuanyu.

04:46.120 --> 04:47.759
To descend the mountain a moment earlier

04:47.759 --> 04:48.800
is to be a moment safer.

04:51.399 --> 04:53.319
You're still in mourning

04:53.319 --> 04:54.680
and there was the matter of Luoyang previously.

04:55.319 --> 04:57.879
Not reflecting properly at home,

04:57.879 --> 05:00.279
you gallop on horseback.
What kind of conduct is this?

05:03.720 --> 05:05.040
About the matter of choosing your husband,

05:05.040 --> 05:06.040
I will make arrangements.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.639
You needn't worry about it.

05:07.639 --> 05:09.000
Father,

05:09.920 --> 05:11.199
in your eyes,

05:11.199 --> 05:12.720
Jiang Changyang accompanies
by the emperor's side,

05:12.720 --> 05:13.839
forming family ties and alliances.

05:13.839 --> 05:15.879
Naturally, his actions will be facilitated.

05:15.879 --> 05:17.879
But for the matter of Luoyang,
he was pleased to see it.

05:17.879 --> 05:19.920
He has no desire to marry me at all.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.319
If it weren't for your emotions
clouding your judgment,

05:21.319 --> 05:22.519
leading to you committing a disgrace,

05:22.519 --> 05:24.199
we wouldn't need to consider his willingness.

05:25.480 --> 05:27.079
Well now.

05:27.079 --> 05:28.720
This has become his excuse for evasion.

05:32.920 --> 05:34.000
Causing you to be shamed

05:34.000 --> 05:35.120
is my lack of filial piety.

05:35.720 --> 05:36.839
What kind of conduct is this?

05:36.839 --> 05:38.472
Rise.

05:43.120 --> 05:45.399
Father, the Luoyang matter

05:45.399 --> 05:47.560
has already caused an uproar.

05:47.560 --> 05:49.360
If I remarry to someone else,

05:50.199 --> 05:51.240
won't this confirm

05:51.240 --> 05:52.439
those rumors?

05:53.000 --> 05:54.879
But if I marry into the Liu family,

05:54.879 --> 05:56.360
it would just be a common meeting.

05:56.360 --> 05:57.519
Nothing is there to be criticized.

05:57.519 --> 05:59.720
You've told me this so many times already.

05:59.720 --> 06:00.720
Aren't you tired?

06:02.279 --> 06:03.519
Father,

06:03.519 --> 06:05.120
I understand,

06:05.120 --> 06:07.879
you don't think the Liu family's status
is high enough.

06:07.879 --> 06:09.360
But looking at the whole of Chang'an,

06:09.360 --> 06:10.360
the young gentlemen

06:10.360 --> 06:11.800
of the noble families

06:11.800 --> 06:13.399
are all like Jiang Changyang.

06:14.000 --> 06:15.920
Relying on their profound family wealth,

06:15.920 --> 06:17.360
they spend all day only knowing
how to have fun.

06:17.879 --> 06:19.879
Even if he marries
an even more splendid county princess,

06:19.879 --> 06:21.839
it would not win his loyalty.

06:22.360 --> 06:24.639
But precisely because the Liu family's
social status is not high,

06:25.319 --> 06:27.319
they can only look up to you as their leader.

06:28.360 --> 06:30.279
If they can be put to good use,

06:30.800 --> 06:32.480
how would that not be considered a sharp sword?

06:35.959 --> 06:37.560
As for other families, let them be.

06:38.759 --> 06:40.839
Won't the Liu family

06:40.839 --> 06:42.800
hold a grudge

06:42.800 --> 06:44.199
for the incident of being demoted
to Luoyang three years ago?

06:45.480 --> 06:46.639
Father,

06:46.639 --> 06:47.800
about the Liu family,

06:47.800 --> 06:49.720
I have a clear understanding of them.

06:49.720 --> 06:52.319
This whole family wants to climb up the ranks

06:52.319 --> 06:53.879
and they are eager to serve you loyally.

06:55.079 --> 06:56.639
Liu Shen

06:56.639 --> 06:58.199
is good at amassing wealth

06:58.199 --> 06:59.480
and acts very cautiously.

07:02.759 --> 07:05.279
Some matters hidden in the shadows

07:06.000 --> 07:08.720
require some people who know
the ins and outs to handle.

07:09.360 --> 07:10.879
Indeed, Father.

07:10.879 --> 07:12.839
Zishu, having studied hard since childhood,

07:12.839 --> 07:14.079
harbors great ambitions.

07:14.079 --> 07:16.079
If you can provide a bit of support,

07:16.079 --> 07:17.399
he will certainly become

07:17.399 --> 07:18.759
a capable minister
in handling affairs and strategizing.

07:19.319 --> 07:21.160
My son-in-law

07:21.160 --> 07:22.759
will certainly rise to high position.

07:27.040 --> 07:28.392
Youzhen,

07:29.399 --> 07:30.720
as you have been married for three years,

07:31.439 --> 07:32.959
your judgement

07:32.959 --> 07:34.680
has become much more perceptive.

07:34.680 --> 07:36.199
You've learned to consider the bigger picture.

07:39.519 --> 07:42.120
Alright, I'll follow your advice.

07:43.160 --> 07:44.360
Thank you, Father.

07:44.360 --> 07:45.879
I will send a message
to the Liu family right now

07:45.879 --> 07:47.240
to have Zishu come to Chang'an quickly

07:47.240 --> 07:48.720
to give thanks to you in person.

08:05.360 --> 08:08.040
Mr. Jiang, the gold and jade items
in this carriage

08:08.040 --> 08:10.759
are worth several properties in Chang'an.

08:12.000 --> 08:13.439
Thank you for giving me a ride.

08:14.079 --> 08:15.560
It truly

08:15.560 --> 08:16.759
has broadened my horizons.

08:17.600 --> 08:19.879
This act must naturally be complete.

08:21.199 --> 08:23.439
I am known for my elegance.

08:23.439 --> 08:24.839
If people see

08:24.839 --> 08:26.079
a woman covered in mud with disheveled hair

08:26.079 --> 08:28.800
walking out from my camp,

08:28.800 --> 08:29.920
that would be unacceptable.

08:31.800 --> 08:33.160
Wipe it off.

08:53.080 --> 08:54.360
You want this?

08:57.519 --> 09:00.080
If you continue to dig peonies
with this scrap metal,

09:00.679 --> 09:02.840
in a few days, your hand will be useless.

09:03.679 --> 09:04.840
Wouldn't my business

09:05.399 --> 09:06.799
be a loss?

09:07.320 --> 09:08.600
Mr. Jiang, rest assured.

09:08.600 --> 09:10.000
I have already made money now.

09:10.000 --> 09:11.879
Now I can buy proper farm tools.

09:11.879 --> 09:13.279
In the future, I will avoid

09:13.279 --> 09:14.759
the royal hunting grounds.

09:14.759 --> 09:16.320
I will definitely not make you lose money.

09:20.399 --> 09:21.576
Stop.

09:22.440 --> 09:23.688
Greetings, Your Highness.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.960
I didn't see you in the hunting grounds.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.200
I heard you

09:34.200 --> 09:35.840
ran away with a young lady.

09:35.840 --> 09:37.639
A beauty from which family

09:37.639 --> 09:38.679
made you so

09:38.679 --> 09:40.159
impatient to hide her away?

09:40.720 --> 09:42.279
She

09:42.279 --> 09:44.000
just saw me once

09:44.000 --> 09:45.919
and fell at the sight of my valiant presence.

09:46.440 --> 09:48.240
Her face is flushed at the moment.

09:48.799 --> 09:51.360
Could it be she's a spirit transformed
from these mountains?

09:51.360 --> 09:52.960
Thus she is so shy to meet people.

09:53.679 --> 09:55.200
Your Highness, look,

09:55.200 --> 09:56.879
it's such a pure and beautiful lady.

09:56.879 --> 09:58.360
How could I not enjoy her exclusively?

10:01.039 --> 10:02.360
Well,

10:02.360 --> 10:04.759
you are usually surrounded by servants.

10:04.759 --> 10:06.000
Yet now you're riding alone

10:06.000 --> 10:07.120
and are smiling broadly.

10:07.679 --> 10:09.279
It seems you have got what you wished for.

10:10.080 --> 10:13.600
A few days ago, I learned
Zishu's wife died falling off a cliff.

10:13.600 --> 10:15.240
Today, my father consented

10:15.240 --> 10:16.639
to my marriage with Zishu.

10:17.320 --> 10:19.120
There are no longer any obstacles
between me and Zishu.

10:19.919 --> 10:21.320
Thank you

10:21.320 --> 10:22.320
for facilitating this match.

10:29.600 --> 10:30.856
Let's set off.

10:45.240 --> 10:46.679
Mr. Jiang, what do you mean by this?

10:47.600 --> 10:49.200
Just now, when you heard
the County Princess's voice,

10:49.200 --> 10:50.399
you looked as if you had seen a ghost.

10:51.519 --> 10:54.480
I never thought that the one who actually
saw a ghost was me.

10:56.000 --> 10:58.440
He Weifang is already dead.

11:01.600 --> 11:03.000
I was

11:03.519 --> 11:04.840
just lucky.

11:04.840 --> 11:06.559
I fell off a cliff

11:06.559 --> 11:07.600
and luckily survived.

11:08.399 --> 11:10.080
Creating a fake household registration
has one price.

11:10.919 --> 11:12.480
But if I help you hide it
from the County Princess and Prince Ning,

11:12.480 --> 11:13.840
that would be another price altogether.

11:14.360 --> 11:15.960
Give me the contract, I'm raising the price.

11:18.919 --> 11:20.039
A gentleman's promise is unbreakable.

11:20.039 --> 11:21.879
Moreover, our contract has already been signed.

11:22.840 --> 11:25.360
Mr. Jiang, you are a person of integrity.

11:25.360 --> 11:27.159
You certainly wouldn't take advantage
of the situation.

11:27.159 --> 11:28.616
Moreover…

11:30.159 --> 11:31.919
Moreover, He Weifang is already dead.

11:32.799 --> 11:33.919
Jiang Xiaohua absolutely will not

11:33.919 --> 11:35.120
cause you any trouble.

11:37.000 --> 11:39.120
This trouble won't fall on my head.

11:40.799 --> 11:42.440
Liu Zishu is coming to Chang'an.

11:43.919 --> 11:45.080
You'd better pray for good fortune.

11:48.480 --> 11:51.679
The Liu family has already obtained
the money and power they were after.

11:52.320 --> 11:54.159
They won't care about someone like me anymore.

11:55.960 --> 11:57.160
Furthermore,

11:58.080 --> 12:00.360
regardless of whether the Liu family
will come to Chang'an or not

12:01.600 --> 12:02.639
or when they come to Chang'an,

12:03.919 --> 12:05.288
when the time comes,

12:06.279 --> 12:07.919
I will seek them out.

12:13.679 --> 12:15.360
But these matters no longer concern you.

12:16.320 --> 12:17.480
In any case,

12:17.480 --> 12:18.519
my good fortune

12:18.519 --> 12:19.960
and your interest,

12:19.960 --> 12:21.720
I will earn it pot by pot.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.080
Just you wait and see.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.120
I did as you said.

12:42.120 --> 12:44.639
I used sun-dried fresh cow
and sheep dung as base fertilizer.

12:44.639 --> 12:46.720
These three pots have added
irrigation fertilizer.

12:46.720 --> 12:48.039
The mix ratios of fertilizer and water are

12:48.039 --> 12:50.320
thirty-five percent, twenty-five percent,
and twenty percent respectively.

12:50.320 --> 12:52.279
The roots have indeed grown much stronger.

12:53.320 --> 12:54.919
Very good.

12:54.919 --> 12:56.519
Shengyi, look.

12:56.519 --> 12:57.600
This first pot here

12:57.600 --> 12:58.919
has some burnt roots.

12:59.720 --> 13:00.799
This third pot,

13:00.799 --> 13:01.960
look at the main root.

13:01.960 --> 13:03.039
It's grown less than half an inch thicker.

13:03.679 --> 13:05.399
This is the second pot.

13:05.399 --> 13:07.519
This is the main root. It has grown stronger

13:07.519 --> 13:09.200
and it has sprouted lateral roots.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.960
It just hasn't sprouted buds yet.

13:11.480 --> 13:13.159
Come on, let's put this back first.

13:16.879 --> 13:18.120
Remember this.

13:18.120 --> 13:19.360
Between taking the first pot

13:19.360 --> 13:20.720
and the second pot,

13:21.320 --> 13:23.000
mix the fertilizer and water
at a ratio of thirty percent

13:23.000 --> 13:24.639
to prepare the irrigation fertilizer.

13:24.639 --> 13:26.559
With such fertilization,

13:26.559 --> 13:28.440
will it bloom soon?

13:29.519 --> 13:31.519
No rush, we will move these flowers

13:31.519 --> 13:33.159
to get more sunlight.

13:33.159 --> 13:35.000
Move them back indoors when night falls.

13:35.720 --> 13:37.279
When changing the fertilizer,

13:37.279 --> 13:38.480
we need to chill the roots.

13:38.480 --> 13:40.080
I'm afraid we won't be able

13:40.080 --> 13:41.159
to warm ourselves by the fire at night.

13:42.200 --> 13:43.679
It's fine.

13:43.679 --> 13:44.960
The dwarf peony is delicate.

13:44.960 --> 13:46.720
We should accommodate it.

13:47.279 --> 13:49.240
Okay, if it's cold at night,

13:49.240 --> 13:50.519
we two

13:50.519 --> 13:52.000
will sleep huddled together.

13:52.000 --> 13:53.256
Okay.

14:35.480 --> 14:36.759
It's raining.

14:36.759 --> 14:37.879
You're awake, Shengyi.

14:38.519 --> 14:39.559
How are the flowers?

14:41.240 --> 14:42.360
Now that you're awake,

14:42.360 --> 14:43.840
let's go have a look at the flowers together.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.760
Come on.

14:54.519 --> 14:56.600
Good, they haven't been too drenched.

15:14.000 --> 15:15.560
Shengyi,

15:16.639 --> 15:18.568
these flowers

15:22.120 --> 15:23.200
have made it.

15:24.759 --> 15:25.759
Made it.

15:29.559 --> 15:30.888
Made it.

15:33.440 --> 15:34.696
Look.

15:40.120 --> 15:42.039
Shengyi,

15:42.039 --> 15:43.120
do you know?

15:43.120 --> 15:45.440
Most peony flowers have elegant names

15:45.440 --> 15:48.600
like Ningyan Zi or Qiongtai Yulu.

15:48.600 --> 15:50.279
Either describing the color

15:50.279 --> 15:51.480
or depicting the posture.

15:52.159 --> 15:53.639
How about we give this dwarf peony

15:53.639 --> 15:54.639
a name as well?

15:56.279 --> 15:57.759
I'm not versed in literature.

15:57.759 --> 15:59.159
I don't know any fancy words.

15:59.919 --> 16:02.159
But I think although this flower is small,

16:02.159 --> 16:03.480
it has a strong fragrance.

16:06.080 --> 16:07.919
Look, I've been busy all day

16:07.919 --> 16:10.080
and the fragrance has clung to my sleeves.

16:11.879 --> 16:13.200
Smelling it is comforting.

16:16.039 --> 16:17.512
Wait.

16:19.919 --> 16:20.960
Look,

16:20.960 --> 16:22.720
fragrance fills the sleeves.

16:23.320 --> 16:24.759
Why not just call it

16:29.600 --> 16:30.920
[Huai]
Huai

16:34.120 --> 16:35.240
[Xiu]
Xiu

16:39.720 --> 16:41.360
[Xiang]
Xiang?

16:41.360 --> 16:42.519
Huaixiuxiang.

16:43.519 --> 16:44.720
This name

16:44.720 --> 16:46.720
refers to the petite stature of its plant,

16:46.720 --> 16:48.240
small enough to be concealed in a sleeve,

16:48.240 --> 16:49.679
and praises its pleasant floral fragrance.

16:50.480 --> 16:52.799
Royal families often enjoy
the aroma of incense.

16:52.799 --> 16:54.519
Now with this Huaixiuxiang,

16:54.519 --> 16:56.240
even peddlers can afford to enjoy

16:56.240 --> 16:57.679
such an elegant delight.

17:13.893 --> 17:15.272
[Huaixiuxiang]

17:16.279 --> 17:18.319
Everyone, take a look.

17:18.319 --> 17:20.720
Affordable peony Huaixiuxiang.

17:20.720 --> 17:21.839
The size of the potted plant.

17:21.839 --> 17:23.400
With abundant blooms and a rich fragrance.

17:23.400 --> 17:24.440
80 wen per pot.

17:24.440 --> 17:25.880
150 wen for two pots.

17:25.880 --> 17:27.279
Everyone, have a look.

17:27.279 --> 17:29.200
80 wen for a pot of peonies.

17:29.200 --> 17:31.200
Any respectable peony

17:31.200 --> 17:32.680
would cost at least a few hundred wen.

17:32.680 --> 17:34.079
Yes.

17:34.079 --> 17:37.160
I've never heard of a peony

17:37.160 --> 17:39.039
of the variety called Huaixiuxiang.

17:39.039 --> 17:40.319
Any peony

17:40.319 --> 17:41.799
is usually found blooming in gardens

17:41.799 --> 17:43.359
with large clusters of blooms.

17:43.359 --> 17:45.039
With this size of your potted plant,

17:45.039 --> 17:46.799
can it bloom?

17:46.799 --> 17:48.039
Or are you just selling bare roots?

17:48.599 --> 17:49.640
Rest assured, everyone.

17:49.640 --> 17:51.119
For a businessperson traveling far from home,

17:51.119 --> 17:52.400
integrity is the foundation.

17:52.400 --> 17:54.440
80 wen means 80 wen.

17:54.440 --> 17:55.816
Shengyi.

17:57.200 --> 17:59.079
These are all genuine peonies.

17:59.079 --> 18:01.480
- Every single plant blooms splendidly.
- So beautiful.

18:01.480 --> 18:02.640
Madam, come here.

18:02.640 --> 18:04.279
Little boy, come forward and have a look.

18:04.279 --> 18:05.519
Is this not a peony?

18:05.519 --> 18:07.039
Yes.

18:07.039 --> 18:08.839
Although Huaixiuxiang is small in size,

18:08.839 --> 18:11.400
its color and shape are beyond reproach.

18:11.400 --> 18:12.559
It is the king among flowers.

18:12.559 --> 18:15.519
Its fragrance is truly unique.
Take a sniff, isn't it?

18:15.519 --> 18:17.319
It really is a peony.

18:17.319 --> 18:18.440
- Smells good, right?
- It's a dwarf peony.

18:18.440 --> 18:20.319
- Really fragrant.
- It can actually bloom

18:20.319 --> 18:21.599
and the flowers are blooming so nicely.

18:22.119 --> 18:23.680
It's really amazing.

18:23.680 --> 18:25.240
Not just the name has changed.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.559
Even the appearance

18:26.559 --> 18:27.960
has been completely transformed.

18:27.960 --> 18:29.279
The previous dwarf peony

18:29.279 --> 18:31.359
was small, ugly, and still cost 50 wen.

18:31.359 --> 18:32.880
Now this one is completely renewed.

18:32.880 --> 18:35.839
With abundant flowers, it's only 80 wen!

18:35.839 --> 18:37.359
This flower is not easy to cultivate.

18:37.359 --> 18:38.759
Once sold out, I'll pack up the stand.

18:38.759 --> 18:41.519
Don't hesitate if you're interested.
First come first served.

18:42.160 --> 18:43.839
- I'll take two pots first.
- Madam, are you buying?

18:43.839 --> 18:45.279
- Yes.
- Alright.

18:45.279 --> 18:46.519
I'll take one pot.

18:46.519 --> 18:47.680
I'll take one too.

18:47.680 --> 18:49.319
- Can I get a discount for buying more?
- Yes.

18:49.319 --> 18:50.319
I'd like to order ten pots.

18:50.319 --> 18:51.640
Can you restock by tomorrow?

18:51.640 --> 18:54.240
Of course. If you want to place an order,
come here to sign up.

18:54.240 --> 18:55.400
I'll restock within three days.

18:56.559 --> 18:57.680
Kid, can you carry that?

18:57.680 --> 18:59.279
- Sure.
- Here.

18:59.279 --> 19:00.880
You're strong.

19:00.880 --> 19:02.759
- I'll buy one pot.
- Alright.

19:02.759 --> 19:04.720
- I'll buy one pot too.
- Quickly, I want to order ten pots.

19:04.720 --> 19:06.400
- Okay, ten pots, right?
- Ten pots.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.400
Those who want to order, come to me.

19:08.920 --> 19:10.559
You can restock ten pots by tomorrow, right?

19:10.559 --> 19:11.559
I'll restock within three days.

19:11.559 --> 19:12.880
- Sure.
- Ten pots.

19:33.920 --> 19:35.160
The medicine indeed worked.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.279
The cold symptoms are much better now.

19:36.880 --> 19:38.359
You must not be careless either.

19:38.880 --> 19:40.920
This decoction is ready.
Don't forget to drink it.

19:40.920 --> 19:42.000
Okay, I'll drink it in a bit.

19:45.799 --> 19:48.720
Never thought selling flowers would
be more profitable than selling liquor.

19:48.720 --> 19:50.599
Today is only the first batch.

19:50.599 --> 19:51.839
In a few more days,

19:51.839 --> 19:53.680
we could earn hundreds of strings.

19:57.319 --> 19:59.400
However, once we pay back the interest,

20:00.119 --> 20:01.400
there won't be much left.

20:03.839 --> 20:06.279
Shengyi, how about we rent a house first?

20:07.400 --> 20:08.839
But we still owe interest

20:08.839 --> 20:09.839
to the Floral Envoy.

20:11.079 --> 20:13.359
No rush, it's not the end of the month yet.

20:13.880 --> 20:15.079
The initial phase of the business

20:15.079 --> 20:16.640
is when we need to spend money.

20:16.640 --> 20:17.839
We need to purchase more flowers

20:17.839 --> 20:19.200
and tools as well.

20:19.200 --> 20:20.480
I've done the math.

20:20.480 --> 20:22.039
Excluding these expenses,

20:22.039 --> 20:23.279
it's enough to rent a house.

20:24.960 --> 20:26.480
The land prices in Chang'an are high.

20:27.039 --> 20:28.920
Renting a house is a significant expenditure.

20:29.799 --> 20:31.799
We have just started doing business.

20:32.799 --> 20:34.279
Wouldn't that be too extravagant?

20:35.000 --> 20:37.160
This house is situated in a low-lying area
next to the river.

20:37.160 --> 20:39.160
The dampness is really too much.

20:39.160 --> 20:40.880
Moreover, when it rains,

20:40.880 --> 20:42.400
the roof leaks.

20:42.400 --> 20:44.480
Over time, these peonies will surely
not be able to withstand it.

20:45.680 --> 20:48.279
Furthermore, even if the peonies can endure,

20:48.880 --> 20:50.920
I can't bear to let you suffer with me.

20:51.799 --> 20:53.200
If one falls ill,

20:53.200 --> 20:55.160
no amount of money earned can be enjoyed.

20:55.839 --> 20:57.759
As long as the two of us
work together wholeheartedly,

20:57.759 --> 20:59.680
we will eventually be able

20:59.680 --> 21:00.799
to earn back all this money.

21:01.839 --> 21:03.119
Ladies,

21:03.119 --> 21:05.319
you've seen the finest residences

21:05.319 --> 21:06.960
I have on hand.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.559
Isn't there one that you fancy?

21:09.880 --> 21:11.079
Sir,

21:11.079 --> 21:13.119
we have already stated our requests.

21:13.119 --> 21:14.960
But what you have shown us

21:14.960 --> 21:16.640
is not what we want in a residence.

21:17.559 --> 21:19.519
Actually, those were quite nice.

21:19.519 --> 21:21.079
But those by the river or lake,

21:21.079 --> 21:22.319
although picturesque,

21:22.319 --> 21:23.519
are damp,

21:23.519 --> 21:25.319
sit low, and are prone to flooding.

21:25.319 --> 21:26.359
The detached homes,

21:26.359 --> 21:27.680
although clean and refreshing,

21:27.680 --> 21:29.559
lack sufficient fertile soil

21:29.559 --> 21:30.960
or open space.

21:30.960 --> 21:32.279
And those facing the street

21:32.279 --> 21:33.799
just have far too much pedestrian traffic.

21:33.799 --> 21:36.680
After all, looking for a house
is about convenience, right?

21:36.680 --> 21:38.960
The conditions you're asking for are too harsh.

21:38.960 --> 21:40.759
Do you really want to live on a smelly mudflat?

21:41.599 --> 21:42.920
So there really isn't

21:42.920 --> 21:44.680
the type of house we're talking about?

21:46.279 --> 21:47.319
There are some, indeed.

21:53.000 --> 21:54.408
Be careful.

22:22.880 --> 22:25.119
This soil is full of decomposed leaves,

22:25.119 --> 22:26.119
with just the right amount of moisture.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.880
It's our ready-made fertilizer.

22:28.880 --> 22:29.920
Let's rent this house then.

22:32.079 --> 22:34.079
Don't rush, wait a moment.

22:40.799 --> 22:43.440
This courtyard is indeed large,

22:43.440 --> 22:45.599
but it's too dirty and run-down.

22:45.599 --> 22:47.000
How can anyone live here?

22:48.079 --> 22:49.960
It is a bit dirty and worn here,

22:49.960 --> 22:51.559
but the price is really cheap.

22:51.559 --> 22:53.480
Moreover, this is

22:53.480 --> 22:55.160
right next to the residence
of the Floral Envoy.

22:55.160 --> 22:56.960
Having the powerful as neighbors for support,

22:56.960 --> 22:58.559
bandits would never dare
to cause trouble at your door.

22:59.839 --> 23:02.160
This Floral Envoy is reckless and unrestrained

23:02.160 --> 23:03.559
with a notorious reputation.

23:03.559 --> 23:06.519
This infamy far exceeds that
of wandering bandits and brigands.

23:06.519 --> 23:08.440
Who would dare to be his neighbor?

23:09.759 --> 23:11.160
Although the Floral Envoy

23:11.160 --> 23:12.440
is arrogant and absurd

23:13.240 --> 23:14.319
and has made a bit of a fuss,

23:14.319 --> 23:16.680
he has never committed the atrocity of forcing
himself on the daughters of the common people.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.200
Besides,

23:18.200 --> 23:19.960
this place is right next to the back courtyard
of the Jiang Mansion.

23:20.519 --> 23:22.279
It is very far from the main house.

23:22.279 --> 23:24.119
It's absolutely quiet and safe.

23:24.119 --> 23:26.680
You can be at ease.

23:26.680 --> 23:27.816
It's no trouble.

23:28.799 --> 23:30.319
This matter is of great importance.

23:30.319 --> 23:32.000
Allow us to discuss it properly.

23:36.359 --> 23:38.240
If we become neighbors with Jiang Changyang,

23:39.279 --> 23:41.680
as long as we manage our relations well,

23:41.680 --> 23:43.240
in the future, whether it's to extract money

23:43.240 --> 23:44.279
or buy on credit,

23:44.279 --> 23:45.599
it would be very convenient.

23:48.799 --> 23:50.184
Let's go.

23:53.359 --> 23:54.559
Look,

23:54.559 --> 23:56.440
we two weak women,

23:56.440 --> 23:58.920
living next to such a scoundrel official,

23:58.920 --> 24:00.359
really are a bit frightened.

24:00.359 --> 24:01.440
Indeed.

24:01.440 --> 24:02.880
Unless

24:02.880 --> 24:04.440
the price is cheap enough.

24:04.960 --> 24:06.504
Exactly.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.400
Leave it to me.

24:08.400 --> 24:10.120
Absolutely cheap.

24:43.000 --> 24:44.392
Greetings, Your Highness.

24:59.960 --> 25:01.160
Zishu.

25:02.000 --> 25:03.160
Greetings, Your Highness.

25:03.160 --> 25:04.240
You've arrived in a hurry

25:04.240 --> 25:05.440
and traveled hastily on the road.

25:06.079 --> 25:07.656
You must be exhausted.

25:08.319 --> 25:09.640
It's no trouble.

25:09.640 --> 25:10.839
After I settle in at the posthouse,

25:10.839 --> 25:12.359
I will visit Prince Ning's Mansion.

25:13.480 --> 25:15.039
Why must you make this trip?

25:16.119 --> 25:17.279
Weisheng kept his promise.

25:17.279 --> 25:18.759
He would rather die embracing the column.

25:19.440 --> 25:21.440
I have said that I would wait for your return.

25:22.319 --> 25:23.319
I hoped the first old friend you see

25:23.319 --> 25:24.839
when entering Chang'an

25:24.839 --> 25:25.839
would be me.

25:29.359 --> 25:31.599
Let's go to Prince Ning's Mansion.

25:32.279 --> 25:33.279
You've already come to this place.

25:33.279 --> 25:34.824
Won't you go in and have a look?

25:34.824 --> 25:35.944
Let's go.

25:43.976 --> 25:46.760
[Liu Mansion]

25:49.576 --> 25:51.464
[Liu Mansion]

25:55.359 --> 25:56.880
I know you miss the old home.

25:56.880 --> 25:59.400
Returning to Chang'an,
you'd surely pass by here.

25:59.400 --> 26:01.480
That's why I came here specially
to wait for you.

26:10.680 --> 26:14.400
We respectfully welcome
Your Highness and Mr. Liu home.

26:17.000 --> 26:18.200
Wasn't this mansion

26:18.200 --> 26:19.680
sold when we

26:19.680 --> 26:21.039
left Chang'an?

26:21.039 --> 26:22.519
I have said it before.

26:22.519 --> 26:24.039
The old scenes of Chang'an remain as yesterday

26:24.039 --> 26:25.160
and my heart remains the same.

26:26.319 --> 26:27.680
As long as you are willing to come back,

26:28.480 --> 26:30.440
we can start anew.

26:33.440 --> 26:35.400
Youzhen, thank you.

26:38.079 --> 26:39.519
As long as you are happy.

26:48.400 --> 26:50.680
The government-arranged posthouse is humble.

26:50.680 --> 26:53.000
Now you can live comfortably in your old home.

26:53.000 --> 26:54.559
That would put my mind at ease.

26:55.680 --> 26:57.279
The Ministry of Revenue where you will serve

26:57.279 --> 26:58.720
has already been arranged by my father.

26:59.359 --> 27:02.240
There aren't many vacant official positions
nowadays.

27:02.240 --> 27:04.079
So you will serve as the Additional Secretary
in the Ministry of Revenue.

27:04.079 --> 27:05.640
It's just a temporary measure.

27:05.640 --> 27:08.000
You will surely be promoted in the future.

27:12.200 --> 27:14.279
Youzhen, as I've stated in the letter,

27:15.200 --> 27:16.960
I will certainly pass the imperial examination
with distinction this year

27:16.960 --> 27:18.880
and rightfully secure an official position.

27:19.799 --> 27:21.319
I began my learning at the age of five.

27:21.319 --> 27:22.839
Only by seeking office
through the imperial exams

27:22.839 --> 27:24.359
and relying on talent for promotion

27:24.359 --> 27:26.000
will my heart be truly at ease.

27:27.079 --> 27:29.200
If I were to complacently enjoy
this granted position,

27:29.200 --> 27:31.559
how could my colleagues genuinely respect me?

27:32.480 --> 27:34.079
Zishu, your ambitions are lofty,

27:34.079 --> 27:35.880
which I naturally understand.

27:35.880 --> 27:37.920
But even if you do excel
in the imperial examination,

27:37.920 --> 27:38.920
you would still have to start from a local

27:38.920 --> 27:40.240
position like a county magistrate.

27:41.200 --> 27:42.440
As a minor official,

27:42.440 --> 27:44.319
you won't be able to unfold
your great aspirations.

27:44.319 --> 27:45.599
With a higher rank,

27:45.599 --> 27:47.319
you will better exhibit your strengths.

27:47.319 --> 27:48.712
Isn't that so?

27:51.799 --> 27:53.480
You're full of talent.

27:53.480 --> 27:54.920
I think becoming an Additional Secretary

27:54.920 --> 27:56.559
is a waste of your abilities.

27:56.559 --> 27:57.928
Besides,

27:58.599 --> 28:00.319
I truly do not wish to part with you again.

28:07.960 --> 28:09.320
This is for you.

28:11.880 --> 28:13.039
With this,

28:13.039 --> 28:15.119
[Notice Chang'an]
you may enter Prince Ning's Mansion as you please.

28:22.039 --> 28:23.112
Zishu,

28:23.839 --> 28:24.920
you've finally returned.

28:26.240 --> 28:27.480
In the days to come,

28:28.720 --> 28:30.319
I will have something to look forward to.

28:38.408 --> 28:39.880
[Notice Chang'an]

28:48.281 --> 28:52.168
[Ministry of Revenue]

28:54.160 --> 28:55.839
Mr. Liu, please come in.

28:55.839 --> 28:57.000
Mr. Hu, after you.

29:03.920 --> 29:05.839
I've had someone

29:05.839 --> 29:07.599
clean and refurbish this room anew

29:07.599 --> 29:10.599
and added a few scholar's furnishings.

29:10.599 --> 29:12.799
Mr. Liu, see if it meets your satisfaction.

29:13.759 --> 29:15.160
You are my superior.

29:15.720 --> 29:17.359
How could you be so polite to me?

29:18.559 --> 29:20.400
I am but an Additional Secretary
of the sixth rank.

29:20.400 --> 29:23.640
According to protocol, I should share a room
with other officials and Additional Secretaries.

29:24.160 --> 29:25.799
This is truly improper.

29:27.039 --> 29:29.519
You are the prospective son-in-law
of Prince Ning.

29:29.519 --> 29:31.440
I should be polite to you.

29:33.319 --> 29:35.920
The Ministry of Revenue
has no decent vacant rooms.

29:35.920 --> 29:37.759
This room was previously used by me.

29:38.279 --> 29:39.599
Mr. Liu, just don't disdain this room

29:39.599 --> 29:40.799
for being old or worn.

29:41.599 --> 29:43.079
In front of His Highness,

29:43.079 --> 29:44.359
please put in a good word for me.

29:44.960 --> 29:47.039
Mr. Hu, there's really no need for this.

29:48.160 --> 29:50.279
I've just arrived,
solely to study and gain experience.

29:51.119 --> 29:52.319
As I associate with my colleagues,

29:52.319 --> 29:54.039
if there are things I don't understand,

29:54.039 --> 29:55.880
I will need the teachings of you all.

29:57.240 --> 29:58.240
His Highness has said

29:58.240 --> 30:00.559
you are well-informed and knowledgeable.

30:00.559 --> 30:01.799
We must not treat you lightly.

30:02.759 --> 30:05.599
Mr. Liu, you flatter me too much.

30:08.119 --> 30:11.680
Is there any other assignment at the moment?

30:11.680 --> 30:13.480
Please give your orders, Mr. Hu.

30:13.480 --> 30:15.119
You are jesting.

30:15.119 --> 30:16.720
There's no need to trouble yourself.

30:17.400 --> 30:19.440
Just make yourself at home

30:19.440 --> 30:20.759
and act freely.

30:20.759 --> 30:22.400
Just do whatever you want.

30:23.640 --> 30:26.279
Mr. Hu, I am not a good-for-nothing idler

30:26.279 --> 30:27.480
who bullies others by flaunting power.

30:28.400 --> 30:29.920
Although favored by His Highness,

30:29.920 --> 30:32.200
I wish to do my utmost
to serve the public diligently.

30:33.000 --> 30:34.720
Could I trouble you to fetch
the records and documents

30:34.720 --> 30:36.400
from previous years for me to review?

30:36.400 --> 30:37.400
I would like to familiarize myself

30:37.400 --> 30:39.119
with the duties that fall within my purview.

30:39.119 --> 30:41.279
Alright, I'll go fetch them right now.

30:41.960 --> 30:43.279
Please wait a moment, Mr. Liu.

30:44.079 --> 30:45.448
Thank you for your trouble.

31:01.000 --> 31:03.720
What's the point of holding such a position?

31:05.720 --> 31:07.960
Now I've become someone
who exercises power under false pretenses

31:07.960 --> 31:09.640
and usurps others' nests.

31:15.960 --> 31:17.279
You will become the son-in-law of Prince Ning.

31:17.880 --> 31:19.480
Besides, you're a newly appointed official.

31:19.480 --> 31:21.000
Others are merely fearful and envious.

31:21.599 --> 31:22.960
My lord, why bother yourself with that?

31:25.839 --> 31:27.080
Qiushi,

31:27.920 --> 31:29.319
it's not for the sake of others,

31:30.839 --> 31:32.880
but I do not wish to let down
my own aspirations.

31:36.559 --> 31:37.960
The office I hold

31:37.960 --> 31:39.559
is not attained in a proper manner.

31:40.400 --> 31:41.960
But if I manage to accomplish
some achievements,

31:42.759 --> 31:44.319
the cold stares and idle talk

31:44.319 --> 31:45.640
will dissipate on their own.

31:51.119 --> 31:53.720
In the future, I must rely on my own talents

31:53.720 --> 31:55.039
to rise to prominence.

31:57.039 --> 31:58.880
After finishing the duty and returning home,

31:58.880 --> 32:00.079
I feel I have nothing to do.

32:00.079 --> 32:01.119
It's perfect that Mr. Hu

32:01.119 --> 32:02.640
is inviting us to Huanyun Tower

32:02.640 --> 32:04.079
to drink and enjoy dance performances.

32:07.359 --> 32:09.359
Shall we call that newcomer, Liu Chang?

32:10.799 --> 32:11.799
He's already taken

32:11.799 --> 32:14.200
Mr. Hu's room.

32:14.200 --> 32:15.880
Do we need to go ingratiate ourselves?

32:15.880 --> 32:17.640
Indeed.

32:18.920 --> 32:19.920
Working together

32:19.920 --> 32:21.079
is already tiring enough.

32:21.079 --> 32:22.759
After finishing the duty,
I certainly don't want

32:22.759 --> 32:25.079
to continue to act servilely.

32:25.079 --> 32:26.480
Let's just enjoy ourselves.

32:26.480 --> 32:28.200
- Let's go.
- Go.

33:02.799 --> 33:04.136
Come.

33:05.519 --> 33:06.600
Go.

33:34.720 --> 33:37.079
Shengyi.

33:37.079 --> 33:38.408
Come quickly.

33:39.720 --> 33:41.759
These are ready-made.

33:43.680 --> 33:44.872
So many.

33:45.400 --> 33:46.536
Really nice.

33:48.680 --> 33:50.120
These can all be used.

33:50.120 --> 33:51.144
Can all be used.

33:51.960 --> 33:53.039
Shengyi,

33:53.039 --> 33:54.359
let's not throw away these mats.

33:54.359 --> 33:55.640
They can be used for shade later on.

33:57.799 --> 33:58.799
Lay it down.

33:58.799 --> 33:59.799
Okay.

33:59.799 --> 34:01.039
Be careful.

34:01.039 --> 34:02.039
Just put it on the ground.

34:04.319 --> 34:05.384
Come on.

34:08.559 --> 34:09.920
There's still a lot more.

34:09.920 --> 34:11.679
Shengyi, help me.

34:13.159 --> 34:14.536
Slow down.

34:15.239 --> 34:16.424
Get out of the way.

34:19.559 --> 34:20.936
What is this?

34:24.280 --> 34:26.600
Can it be opened?

34:36.440 --> 34:37.704
Well…

34:37.704 --> 34:40.424
[Land Deed]

34:43.599 --> 34:44.880
So my house

34:45.559 --> 34:47.440
isn't next to the back yard
of the Jiang Mansion.

34:47.960 --> 34:50.159
My house is the back yard of the Jiang Mansion.

34:51.519 --> 34:53.039
I invested money in your business.

34:53.559 --> 34:55.920
Now I haven't made a single penny of profit,

34:55.920 --> 34:57.440
but you switched houses first.

34:58.719 --> 35:00.480
I changed houses in order

35:00.480 --> 35:02.199
to be able to make money better.

35:02.960 --> 35:04.599
Mr. Jiang, look.

35:04.599 --> 35:07.000
This sludge is best for planting flowers.

35:07.679 --> 35:09.920
Rest assured, your profits
at the end of the month

35:09.920 --> 35:11.599
will be delivered to you in full.

35:12.679 --> 35:13.864
Mudan,

35:13.864 --> 35:15.119
there's trouble.

35:15.119 --> 35:16.320
What happened?

35:16.320 --> 35:18.880
Too bad, the house broker has quit and is gone.

35:18.880 --> 35:20.599
He must have absconded with the money.

35:21.119 --> 35:23.119
Darned house broker.

35:23.119 --> 35:24.920
A lone girl bravely enters Chang'an.

35:24.920 --> 35:26.199
Before she achieved great things,

35:26.199 --> 35:27.719
she had been swindled out of her money.

35:28.360 --> 35:30.760
Truly bringing tears of compassion.

35:32.039 --> 35:34.519
Mudan, you mustn't be discouraged.

35:34.519 --> 35:35.599
You have to learn from this

35:36.239 --> 35:38.400
and work even harder to make money.

35:39.039 --> 35:40.400
After all, my ninety percent profit

35:41.039 --> 35:42.760
cannot be shortchanged at all.

35:43.320 --> 35:44.872
Sure.

35:45.559 --> 35:46.679
Chuanyu,

35:46.679 --> 35:48.320
let's show some tenderness for the ladies.

35:48.880 --> 35:51.400
With just the two of them,
moving is really too slow.

35:51.400 --> 35:53.519
Send some people to move all their stuff

35:54.159 --> 35:55.320
out of here.

35:56.119 --> 35:57.639
Yes.

35:57.639 --> 35:59.480
Chuanyu, hold on.

36:00.639 --> 36:03.039
Mr. Jiang, it is my oversight that led
to being deceived in this matter.

36:03.039 --> 36:04.039
But your Jiang Mansion

36:04.039 --> 36:06.159
bears the fault of mismanagement, right?

36:06.159 --> 36:08.199
When the house broker brought us
to see the house,

36:08.199 --> 36:10.239
he sure seemed well-acquainted with the place.

36:10.239 --> 36:11.559
I didn't see any of the Jiang Mansion

36:11.559 --> 36:13.599
staff keeping watch.

36:13.599 --> 36:15.000
Indeed.

36:15.000 --> 36:16.264
Isn't it?

36:19.599 --> 36:20.599
My lord, you have forgotten.

36:21.119 --> 36:22.199
In the past two years,

36:22.199 --> 36:24.079
you suddenly took an interest in brewing wine.

36:24.079 --> 36:25.159
So you bought this neighboring courtyard

36:25.159 --> 36:26.280
to use as a wine cellar.

36:26.840 --> 36:28.960
But after a few months,
you wanted to raise deer

36:29.559 --> 36:30.960
and you neglected this courtyard.

36:30.960 --> 36:32.039
Over time,

36:32.039 --> 36:33.639
perhaps the servants grew lazy

36:34.199 --> 36:35.976
and slackened in their upkeep.

36:36.679 --> 36:38.039
You see,

36:38.039 --> 36:39.199
It's not just my fault, right?

36:40.320 --> 36:41.360
No matter whom we blame,

36:41.920 --> 36:43.519
this is an internal matter
of our Jiang Mansion.

36:44.039 --> 36:46.119
Now you've taken my house.

36:46.760 --> 36:48.360
Who dares to take

36:48.360 --> 36:50.920
and who could take your house?

36:51.760 --> 36:53.239
Mr. Jiang, just look,

36:53.239 --> 36:55.119
this courtyard is deserted.

36:55.119 --> 36:57.039
It's utterly useless to you.

36:57.039 --> 36:58.559
But if rented to us,

36:58.559 --> 37:00.559
we could turn waste into treasure.

37:00.559 --> 37:01.599
The profit

37:01.599 --> 37:02.840
will be doubled.

37:03.440 --> 37:04.744
Yes.

37:06.719 --> 37:08.280
Mr. Jiang,

37:08.280 --> 37:10.199
we are all people who love money.

37:10.199 --> 37:12.320
You surely wouldn't want your money

37:12.920 --> 37:14.039
to go to waste.

37:14.920 --> 37:16.000
Threatening me?

37:16.000 --> 37:18.920
I meant no such thing.

37:18.920 --> 37:21.400
Anyway, I will pay the rent on time.

37:21.400 --> 37:22.599
By the way, Mr. Jiang,

37:22.599 --> 37:25.000
your Qiongtai Yulu has been moved
to the mansion, right?

37:25.000 --> 37:26.159
I've been busy with the move
these past few days.

37:26.159 --> 37:27.159
So I had no time to check them.

37:27.880 --> 37:29.599
Don't know if any flowers are blooming.

37:30.760 --> 37:32.880
Right, Mudan needs to regularly

37:32.880 --> 37:34.760
tend to the Qiongtai Yulu for you.

37:34.760 --> 37:36.559
Now that we have become neighbors,

37:36.559 --> 37:37.840
if there is any problem with the flowers,

37:37.840 --> 37:39.320
Mudan can tend to them at any time.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.960
Isn't that convenient?

37:41.960 --> 37:44.039
Yes, if we leave,

37:44.039 --> 37:45.159
both sides suffer a loss.

37:45.159 --> 37:46.960
But if we stay, it's the best of both worlds.

37:47.599 --> 37:49.440
Firstly, the business

37:49.440 --> 37:51.199
will be done right under your supervision
in the future.

37:51.199 --> 37:52.760
You can be more at ease.

37:52.760 --> 37:55.119
Secondly, I assure

37:55.119 --> 37:57.639
your backyard will bloom splendidly.

37:57.639 --> 37:58.760
Along with this desolate courtyard,

37:58.760 --> 38:00.159
everything will take on a fresh new look

38:00.159 --> 38:01.880
without losing dignity.

38:01.880 --> 38:03.440
You are so smart.

38:03.440 --> 38:05.360
You certainly won't refuse
such a good deal, right?

38:12.079 --> 38:13.119
Since you say

38:13.679 --> 38:15.159
you staying could satisfy both sides

38:15.159 --> 38:16.639
and double the profit.

38:16.639 --> 38:18.320
Then it seems my ninety percent profit

38:18.320 --> 38:19.400
shouldn't be a problem, huh?

38:20.239 --> 38:21.480
Absolutely no problem.

38:23.199 --> 38:25.360
Chuanyu will come to collect the money
at the end of the month.

38:25.360 --> 38:26.519
Not a penny less.

38:26.519 --> 38:27.760
Not a day late.

38:27.760 --> 38:30.159
Otherwise, I'll have someone move you out.

38:30.679 --> 38:31.816
Understood.

38:34.519 --> 38:36.079
I wish you

38:36.079 --> 38:37.199
a pleasant stay.

38:38.199 --> 38:39.199
Right now,

38:39.199 --> 38:40.280
I am both your creditor

38:40.280 --> 38:41.719
and your landlord.

38:41.719 --> 38:43.112
Jiang Xiaohua,

38:43.719 --> 38:45.280
behave well.

38:51.280 --> 38:52.960
Take care, Mr. Jiang.

38:55.039 --> 38:56.280
Which blind house broker

38:56.280 --> 38:57.840
dared to cheat with my house?

38:58.719 --> 39:00.199
Tell the Mr. Ren

39:00.199 --> 39:02.039
to seize him within three days.

39:02.039 --> 39:03.440
Have him spit out all the money.

39:03.440 --> 39:04.679
Then he has to be punished and serve.

39:04.679 --> 39:05.928
Yes.

39:16.079 --> 39:17.416
Shengyi,

39:18.440 --> 39:20.480
didn't we agree to hire someone
to hoe the weeds?

39:20.480 --> 39:22.088
Why did you do it yourself?

39:22.719 --> 39:24.719
These workers complain
that weeding is tough labor

39:24.719 --> 39:26.239
and demand a high price.

39:26.239 --> 39:27.639
We don't have much money.

39:27.639 --> 39:29.280
Let's just do it ourselves.

39:29.280 --> 39:31.480
Indeed, the house repair

39:31.480 --> 39:32.559
and the purchase

39:32.559 --> 39:34.199
of fertilizer and gardening tools

39:34.199 --> 39:35.559
have cost quite a bit.

39:35.559 --> 39:38.440
We really don't have any savings left on hand.

39:38.440 --> 39:39.816
Let's handle it ourselves.

39:40.360 --> 39:41.400
I'm not afraid of hard work.

39:41.400 --> 39:42.719
You go tend to the flowers.

39:42.719 --> 39:43.760
Leave this place to me.

39:43.760 --> 39:45.920
How can I? Right now, from head to toe,

39:45.920 --> 39:47.159
I have boundless energy.

39:47.159 --> 39:48.392
Let's do it together.

40:16.800 --> 40:18.184
Purslane.

40:24.239 --> 40:25.840
Why did you only dig up this much?
Look at mine.

40:25.840 --> 40:27.320
- You're even carrying a basket.
- It's so cheap.

40:27.320 --> 40:28.744
Just dig as much I can.

40:36.199 --> 40:37.719
Mudan,

40:37.719 --> 40:39.000
eat something.

40:39.000 --> 40:40.264
Okay.

40:56.440 --> 40:57.992
What's the matter?

40:59.239 --> 41:01.480
There's something I don't understand.

41:02.199 --> 41:03.880
I'm not sure if I should ask.

41:03.880 --> 41:05.128
Ask away.

41:06.679 --> 41:09.199
Since the purslane can be used
as medicine for sale

41:09.199 --> 41:10.719
and we need money,

41:10.719 --> 41:12.119
why not pick and sell it ourselves?

41:12.639 --> 41:14.559
Charging ten wen to let people pick
as they please,

41:14.559 --> 41:16.199
isn't that giving outsiders a bargain?

41:16.800 --> 41:18.360
Although purslane

41:18.360 --> 41:19.920
is valuable,

41:19.920 --> 41:22.079
it's not nearly as valuable as peonies.

41:23.559 --> 41:25.679
It seems we've lost some money
on medicinal herbs.

41:25.679 --> 41:27.480
But in reality, it has bought us

41:27.480 --> 41:28.679
more time

41:28.679 --> 41:29.760
to profit sooner.

41:30.679 --> 41:31.719
Since I was little, I've been

41:31.719 --> 41:32.960
doing business with my father.

41:32.960 --> 41:34.920
The first thing I learned was

41:34.920 --> 41:36.119
that sometimes,

41:36.119 --> 41:38.679
time is more precious than money.

41:58.590 --> 42:04.864
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:06.718 --> 42:13.402
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:14.078 --> 42:21.276
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:22.270 --> 42:30.622
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:30.622 --> 42:38.165
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:38.819 --> 42:47.006
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:47.006 --> 42:54.817
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:55.422 --> 43:02.714
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:23.390 --> 43:30.273
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:31.574 --> 43:38.268
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the fragrant garden ♫

43:39.025 --> 43:46.327
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:47.011 --> 43:55.320
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

43:55.320 --> 44:02.751
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:03.582 --> 44:11.838
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:11.838 --> 44:19.262
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:20.266 --> 44:27.716
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
